# Sparse Routing

Lightning indexer that scores 4 signal features (emotional valence, domain signal, energy level, urgency) to select top-3 relevant phases from the 9-phase cascade. Core mechanism of [[expert-routing]] in the [[cognitive-substrate]]. Derived from DeepSeek-V3.2 sparse attention patterns.
